 qwen3-vl-30b-a3b-instruct. Switch to OpenAI or any…","🗣 End-to-end voice loop - Whisper STT (mic → text), chat completions, TTS routed through the robot's WebRTC audio sender so the robot's speaker is what talks. (0G doesn't expose TTS yet, so the say block uses your…","🛑 Real Stop button - cooperative cancellation cleanly aborts mic recording, AI calls, and motion mid-trajectory."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/gathint/reachy-blocks/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"305e7bcf75f2bee8ec0670aad9a994f3ae123b1f331d418b7a2acd35631b0482","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.201Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.201Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Scratch-style, no-code dashboard for the Reachy Mini robot, powered by 0G decentralized compute by default. Drag blocks to make Reachy move, talk, listen, and react. Runs entirely in your browser - no install. Includes a built-in 3D simulator so you can try it without owning a robot.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/gathint/reachy-blocks/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in with your HuggingFace account (top-right).","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/gathint/reachy-blocks/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"305e7bcf75f2bee8ec0670aad9a994f3ae123b1f331d418b7a2acd35631b0482","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/gathint/reachy-blocks/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.201Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-05-13T11:27:34.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/gathint/reachy-blocks/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.201Z","hash":"305e7bcf75f2bee8ec0670aad9a994f3ae123b1f331d418b7a2acd35631b0482","originalBytes":4553,"storedBytes":4553,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["robot","reachy","blocks","chat","openai","api","mini","block","browser","provider","tts","against","any","compute","connect","head","key"